  "post_content": "<p>Druida Bar&amp;Drinks ha presentant la seua carta de c&ograve;ctels, totalment renovada, dins de les activitats d&#39;Onda Gastron&ograve;mica. La majoria d&#39;especialitats s&oacute;n creaci&oacute; de Manu Llores Porcar, propietari del local, per&ograve; tamb&eacute; hi ha combinats elaborats per Toni Cort&eacute;s o Yeray Monforte, campions de cocteleria d&#39;Espanya i la Comunitat Valenciana, respectivament.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/IMG_0107.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Les fotografies de la carta impresa s&oacute;n d&#39;Antoni Prades Mart&iacute;nez, de eltriangulo.es, i el disseny de Mateu Vidal Monfort.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/novacartacoctelsdruida/cartacoctelsdruidamanullorensantonipradesmateuvidal.jpg\" alt=\"cartacoctelsdruidamanullorensantonipradesmateuvidal\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/novacartacoctelsdruida/img_0072.jpg\" alt=\"img_0072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/novacartacoctelsdruida/img_0075.jpg\" alt=\"img_0075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/novacartacoctelsdruida/img_0078.jpg\" alt=\"img_0078\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/novacartacoctelsdruida/img_0079.jpg\" alt=\"img_0079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/novacartacoctelsdruida/img_0081.jpg\" alt=\"img_0081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/novacartacoctelsdruida/img_0082.jpg\" alt=\"img_0082\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig